    "Start the %@ run? Route %@ to %@ on vehicle %@." : {
      "comment" : "CarPlay's start confirmation in one line: the run's start time in the agency's zone, the route's number, the headsign, then the vehicle's fleet number, e.g. 'Start the 6:43 AM run? Route 7 to Downtown Seattle on vehicle 4317.'",
